\ls9\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Prefer immutable updates so Angular can detect reference changes cheaply.\cb1 \
\ls9\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Use 
\f2\b signals
\f3\b0  for local reactive state and predictable updates.\cb1 \
\ls9\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Avoid expensive method calls directly in templates.\cb1 \
\ls9\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Use 
\f2\b markForCheck()
\f3\b0  only when needed, not everywhere.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa200\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs38\fsmilli19333 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 5.3 Avoid slow template computations\cb1 \
